SimGolf HD (EA art): licence note

The art in this pack belongs to Electronic Arts. It is the original SimGolf art, AI upscaled.

This pack is distributed only under the EA permission dated 2026-11-26, which covers distribution of the upscaled EA art pack. See PERMISSION.md for the source and date.

The written form of that permission is not yet filed with this pack. File it here before the pack is shared, and update PERMISSION.md with who gave it, when, and what it covers, in writing.

This is not a free licence such as CC-BY-4.0. Do not reuse the art in this pack under a free licence. The pack.toml licence field says LicenseRef-EA-Permission-2026-11-26 for this reason.
